              "qp": 10
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "the absorption spectrum of phycoerythrin",
              "the action spectrum of red algae."
            ],
            "source": {
              "qp": 10
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "figure",
            "id": "fig4.1",
            "caption": "Fig. 4.1",
            "src": "figures/q4_fig4_1.png",
            "alt": "Absorption spectrum of phycoerythrin and action spectrum of red algae, with both vertical scales and the complete line key.",
